hadiths[2]{hadithnumber,text}:
"1785","[AI-translation] Abdullah bin Qais (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya: Do jannatein chaandi ki hain jinkay bartan aur jo un mein hai (chaandi key). Aur do jannatein sonay ki hain jinkay bartan aur jo un mein hai (sonay key). Aur qaum key darmiyaan aur unkey apne Rab ko dekhney key darmiyaan Adan ki Jannat mein uskey chehrey par buzrugi ki chaadar key siwa kuchh nahi hai. (Bukhari: 4878). Allah Taala ka qaul: (Hoorein jo kheymon mein roki huin hain)."
"1786","[AI-translation] Abdullah bin Qais (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya: Beshak Jannat mein khaali moti ka kheyma hai jiska arz saath meel hai. Uskay har koney mein ghar waley hain jo doosron ko nahi dekhtey. Un par momin ghoomta hai. Hadees qareeb guzar chuki hai. (Bukhari: 4880). Allah Taala ka qaul: (Merey aur tumhaarey dushman ko dost na banaao)."
